  <Analysis>
    <Title>Hardware Information (Windows) Extended</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>CPU and Hardware Info from WMI</P>
<P>The latest version of this Analysis can be found here: <A href="http://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/2994556"><FONT color=#000080>http://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/2994556</FONT></A></P>
